sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Mobile client
    participant A as API module
    participant P as PostgreSQL app/ops
    participant R as Redis transport
    participant W as Durable worker
    participant X as AI/evidence/media adapters
    M->>A: POST plan generation (idempotency key)
    A->>P: persist request, job and outbox atomically
    A->>R: enqueue job id after commit
    A-->>M: 202 Accepted + job id
    W->>P: claim lease and heartbeat
    W->>X: retrieve, generate and validate outside transaction
    X-->>W: structured output and permanent asset references
    W->>P: publish READY only if 4 actions + 16 reachable assets
    P-->>W: commit publication
    M->>A: GET job / today plan
    A->>P: read authoritative state
    A-->>M: job state or READY plan
